480
00:20:02,030 --> 00:20:05,843
You just tell it what to do,
what task you want to reward.

481
00:20:05,843 --> 00:20:07,510
And when it completes
that successfully,

482
00:20:07,510 --> 00:20:08,110
you give it a reward.

483
00:20:08,110 --> 00:20:09,610
If it doesn't do
it successfully,

484
00:20:09,610 --> 00:20:13,770
you withhold the reward and
then you rinse and repeat.

485
00:20:13,770 --> 00:20:16,010
Very simple idea, has been
around for a long time.

486
00:20:16,010 --> 00:20:20,130
Started really working, I
would say, in earnest at scale

487
00:20:20,130 --> 00:20:21,700
