01:04:19,530 --> 01:04:21,170
but as active participants.

1510
01:04:21,170 --> 01:04:26,300
And part of the goal and design
of the project this quarter

1511
01:04:26,300 --> 01:04:28,050
is to try to make you
more and more active

1512
01:04:28,050 --> 01:04:30,498
participants in this stack.

1513
01:04:30,498 --> 01:04:32,290
You can blog, you can
tweet, you can write,

1514
01:04:32,290 --> 01:04:34,373
you can share your thoughts
with the world on what

1515
01:04:34,373 --> 01:04:37,490
are the standards you wish
emerge so that your job could

1516
01:04:37,490 --> 01:04:38,690
be easier.

1517
01:04:38,690 --> 01:04:41,873
And hopefully,
some of the people

1518
01:04:41,873 --> 01:04:43,290
in this room who
are going to come

1519
01:04:43,290 --> 01:04:45,810
talk to you, who are running
many of these institutions who

1520
01:04:45,810 --> 01:04:49,610
can help evangelize
these standards,

1521
01:04:49,610 --> 01:04:51,150
adopt them, coordinate them.

1522
01:04:51,150 --> 01:04:53,330
We'll hear from you.

1523
01:04:53,330 --> 01:04:54,890
Cool.

1524
01:04:54,890 --> 01:04:55,430
All right.

1525
01:04:55,430 --> 01:04:56,740
